{
 "readings": {
  "E1": "calendar = D17's dates of the book from its first date to END (D17's last date, read from the approved D17 files); D18 prices on other dates are never read",
  "E2": "decision dates = T0 and the last D17 session of every later ISO week; the decision at the last session is not traded",
  "E3": "label = latest Master row dated <= decision date, per index; IN iff all three SIGN are BUY",
  "E4": "initial position at T0 close, no cost: OUT = 50% GOLDBEES, 50% cash; IN = the basket in force at T0 as drifted since its availableDate (OHLC4 of the first D18 session on or after it), scaled to NAV 1",
  "E5": "a basket takes effect on the first calendar session on or after its availableDate; baskets flagged csv_only_skipped are dropped; weights are renormalised to 1",
  "E6": "stock fill = OHLC4 of the Eikon bar (close if any of open/high/low is blank; last close if the stock has no bar that session)",
  "E7": "costs: one rule for every trade, see the module docstring (cost on the value traded, targets scaled by (V-cost)/V)",
  "E8": "a basket change while IN trades from the old holdings to the new basket (delta trades); while OUT nothing is traded",
  "E9": "a switch and a basket change on the same session: the switch trades into / out of the basket in force that session",
  "E10": "cash level: the extended LBES (D11) as-of on sessions; it covers the window, so the trailing-90-session accrual branch of T03 is removed and the engine asserts that no session of any window lies after the file's last date (0 accrued sessions)",
  "E11": "constant mix: stock share f = invested decision weeks / decision weeks, rebalanced at every decision date's next session (T0 included, as T03.md says) and at every basket change; initial stock holding = drifted basket scaled by f",
  "E13": "R3 live window starts at the first D17 session on or after 2021-11-01 with its own spells and totals, own draws (same seeds), the SAME bounds (HI_in, HI_out from the book's full-window series) and free initial position in the state decided then",
  "E14": "R2 cash = LBES to the session before 2024-01-24, then chained with the desk's LIQUIDCASE returns on sessions (liquidEtfFinal_extended)",
  "E15": "V4(c) always-in runs on the full window (END = D17's last date); G0 = +-0.25 pp/yr overall and +-0.5 pp every calendar year",
  "E16": "GOLDBEES fill: T03's de-spike (OHLC4 of open/high/low clipped to MCX gold's range that day + 0.5%) on every session up to the MCX file's last date (2026-09-28); on later sessions the raw OHLC4 of the Eikon bar, no clipping, no scaling, no tolerance band",
  "T06-1": "sessions_invested (draws.csv, audit.json) = number of daily returns t = 1..T-1 earned while the parent is held, i.e. sessions i = 0..T-2 whose closing position is the parent (a switch decided at decision j is traded at session decision_idx[j]+1 and held from that close); of T-1 = 1,884 on the old window. This reproduces the 945 (rule) and 941 (draw 445) of T03",
  "T06-2": "V4(b): the constant mix is compared after re-running it with T03's stock share f (invested weeks / weeks of T03's 400 decisions), because T06's own f uses the longer decision series; the other comparators and the strategy are compared as run. The published NAV is compared too",
  "T06-3": "V4(c) does not compare with the Step 1 rebuild (data/parent_rebuild_hm/daily.csv is not an APPROVED row): the columns max_rel_diff_vs_step1_rebuild and rebuild_dates_compared of g_engine.csv are therefore empty / 0",
  "T06-4": "the sampler draws one uniform per part, including the last part (whose length is forced), so a draw consumes k uniforms; cumulative probabilities are exact integer prefix sums divided by the exact total (Python int / int, correctly rounded), searchsorted side='right'",
  "T06-5": "V5(c): the sum of the lengths of a draw is fixed, so the draw's mean length has zero variance; the check is therefore made per spell position (the i-th in-spell and the i-th out-spell): the mean of its length over the draws within 4 standard errors (SD over draws / sqrt(draws)) of S/k",
  "T06-6": "inputs.csv is a plain csv with the five columns of PLAN_v2 (no comment line, so any csv reader opens it); the 'As of' date of APPROVED_DATA.md is in audit.json (data.approved_data_as_of). approved_row = '<STATUS> <ID>'. inputs.csv also lists the approved files the engine registers but does not parse (the _columns.csv files, the D05 rebalance history; skipped baskets come from the _holding_weight_sources.csv trace, as in T03), listed in audit.json data.registered_not_parsed",
  "T06-7": "window-coverage check: the through-date of every role the run reads must reach END, except D12 (the de-spike range, raw OHLC4 after it) and the basket files D19/D05, whose through-date is the newest basket (the last basket stays in force; APPROVED_DATA.md allows windows to mid-December 2026)",
  "T06-8": "the 'weeks' of draw_states.npz and of every V3/V5 statement are the weekly decision rows (409 for SCMO_0003, 408 for SCMO_0007 on the full window)",
  "T06-9": "bounds: HI_in and HI_out = the longest in-spell and out-spell of each book's own full-window series (all four books give the same 46 and 40, checked against logs/step_1_spell_counts.json); lo = 2"
 },
